  Turn on extra usage?

  When your 5-hour or weekly plan limit is reached, requests keep going and are billed
  to your API credits (grants first, then your wallet) instead of stopping until the
  limit resets.

  Your wallet's monthly spending limit still applies.


  1. Turn on extra usage  Bill API credits after the plan allowance
› 2. Cancel               Keep stopping at plan limits

